ies, waaronder Kanalen – doorlopend afspelen van een performer, studio, label of bewaard filter."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Премиум-функции, включая каналы — непрерывное воспроизведение исполнителя, студии, тега или сохраненного фильтра."}}}},"hint_purchase_pending_it_unlocks_once":{"localizations":{"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Покупка ожидает — доступ откроется после оплаты."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kjøpet venter – det låses opp når betalingen er fullført."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Achat en attente — le déblocage a lieu une fois le paiement effectué."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Compra pendente — será desbloqueado quando o pagamento for concluído."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"구입 대기 중 — 결제가 완료되면 잠금 해제됩니다."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Købet afventer – det låses op, når betalingen er gennemført."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Zakup oczekuje — zostanie odblokowany po zakończeniu płatności."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Compra pendiente: se desbloqueará cuando se complete el pago."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Purchase pending — it unlocks once payment completes."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Acquisto in sospeso: verrà sbloccato al completamento del pagamento."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"購入は保留中です — 支払いが完了するとロック解除されます。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kauf ausstehend – wird freigeschaltet, sobald die Zahlung abgeschlossen ist."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Aankoop in behandeling – wordt ontgrendeld zodra de betaling is voltooid."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Satın alma bekliyor — ödeme tamamlanınca kilidi açılır."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"购买待处理 — 付款完成后即可解锁。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"購買處理中 — 付款完成後即會解鎖。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Köpet väntar – det låses upp när betalningen är klar."}}}},"hint_puts_performers_against_each_other":{"localizations":{"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Araçlar'da oyuncuları karşı karşıya getirir. Kazananı sen seçersin ve puanları sunucunda güncellenir."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在「工具」中讓演員互相對決。由你選出勝者，其評分會在你的伺服器上更新。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在“工具”中让演员两两对决。你选出胜者，其评分会在你的服务器上更新。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ställer stjärnor mot varandra i Verktyg. Du väljer vinnaren och deras betyg uppdateras på servern."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Lässt in Werkzeuge Darsteller gegeneinander antreten. Du wählst den Gewinner, und ihre Bewertungen werden auf deinem Server aktualisiert."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mette i performer uno contro l'altro in Strumenti. Scegli tu il vincitore e le loro valutazioni vengono aggiornate sul server."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Zet performers tegen elkaar op in Tools. Jij kiest de winnaar en hun beoordelingen worden op je server bijgewerkt."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Сталкивает исполнителей друг с другом в «Инструментах». Вы выбираете победителя, а их рейтинги обновляются на сервере."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"도구에서 배우끼리 대결시킵니다. 승자를 고르면 서버의 별점이 업데이트됩니다."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Setter utøvere opp mot hverandre i Verktøy. Du velger vinneren, og vurderingene oppdateres på serveren."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Zestawia aktorów ze sobą w Narzędziach. Wybierasz zwycięzcę, a ich oceny aktualizują się na serwerze."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Puts performers against each other in Tools. You pick the 